    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya mbere ky'omwezi gwa kashatu, omu mwaka gwa 11 tuli omu buzahe, Omukama akangambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana w'omuntu, ogambire Farao omukama wa Misiri n'embagaye oti: Iwe obuhango nobwiganisa ohai? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leba, ninyija kukulenga omwelezi gwa Lebanoni. Gugira amatagi garungi n'ebibeho bingi, akatwetwe kagwo nikagoba omu bichwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukanywa amaizi, gwanywa amaizi gangi muno gwaraihya, emiiga eyo gunywaho yaikara negera neguzingora mbali gubyairwe, neshuba negoba n'emiti eli omu kibira yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo gukakura gwagya eiguru, gwakira emiti yona y'ekibira. Amatagi gagwo gahanguha garaihya, gakuzibwa amaizi gangi ago gwanyoire guli guto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyonyi zona zayombeka ebishunkuli omu matagi g'omwelezi ogwo, omu kibeho kyagwo ebigunju byona byaba nimwo bizalira. N'amahanga gona agahango gatura omu kibeho ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwabaga gurungi mara guhango, kuba emizi yagwo yagobaga okuzimu aha maizi agangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emielezi y'ebusitani ya Ruhanga tiyagwelengagaho, nangu n'emiberoshi tiyaigaine na matagi gagwo. Kandi amatagi kugalebeshanyia n'emisonobari gakaba gatalikugibonamu kantu. Omu bustani ya Ruhanga talimu muti gwagugobaga omu oburungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkagulengya, naguha amatagi gangi, nangu n'emiti yona ya Edeni ebusitani ya Ruhanga yaguchubira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Orw'ekyo inye Ruhanga Omukama ningamba nti: Orwo omwelezi ogwo guraihize, akatwetwe kagwo kagoba omu bichwi, oburai bwagwo bwagugiza eikuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndagunaga omu mikono y'eihanga elikiza amahanga agandi gona amani, ligubonabonyie kuhonderana n'obubi bwagwo. Naguchwire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamahanga abakatili kushaga amahanga agandi gona, baragutema bashube bagusigeho. Amatagi gagwo garagwa aha mabanga n'omu mpita zona, gahendahendekere omu mifereji y'amaizi. Amahanga gona gararuga omu kibeho kyagwo gagusigeho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo guraba gugwire ahansi guturweho ebinyonyi, n'enyamaishwa zona ziture omu matagi gagwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byona birabaho hataligira miti elikumera aha maizi ey'okukura ekaraihya muno kugobya butwetwe mu bichwi, kandi hatalibaho miti enywa maizi ey'okuraihya nka yonene egyo. Kuba yona amaheleruka gayo gagoba, efe nk'abantu nyakufa, eheleruke ejwangane n'abagya mbali abafu batura.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama Ruhanga nagamba ati: Orwo omwelezi ogwo gurasongoka Sheoli, ndaaragira enyanja y'okuzimu kuguchulira, emigera y'enyanja ngitange kugera, n'enyanja engundu ngilekeze okuhinda, ngambire Lebanoni eguchulire, n'emiti yona ehwe amani aha rw'omwelezi ogwo kuranduka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndatengesa amahanga orwo garahulira nigugwa, orwo ndikugunaga Sheoli hamoi n'abagya mbali abafu batura. N'emiti yona ya Edeni, emirungi muno kaliza eya Lebanoni, yona ekanywa amaizi, okuzimu omu bafu mbali eli eragarukwamu akoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayo erasongoka nagwo Sheoli, egye mbali abaitwa embanda batura. Ee, amahanga agaturaga omu kibeho kyagwo gachweke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu miti ya Edeni ni guhai ogw'olikwiganisa ekitinwa n'obukuru? Ekitinwa nikija kukuhwaho kumoi n'emiti ya Edeni, ogye okuzimu omu bafu, ogwe omu batatahiriirwe n'abaisirwe embanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omwelezi ogwo ni Farao n'embagaye yona. Alikugamba n'inye Ruhanga Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
